081806C4 scene-motion-return

SceneMotion_InitState stores the result of SabataFrost_Create via r1 and
returns it unchanged in r0. ProximityVolume_InitializeCallbacks forwards it.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/engine/video/sprite_component/SceneMotion_InitState.c
+++ b/src/engine/video/sprite_component/SceneMotion_InitState.c
@@ -23,4 +23,6 @@
     motion->task = task;
     motion->active = 0;
-    /* Original ABI leaves the task result in r0; callers ignore it. */
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return task; // r0 still holds the SabataFrost_Create result
+#endif
 }
